pan><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Proposition1.2.4 print13/PDF25 and first-order rules §2.1–2.2; local instance-closure extension"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span> 为本册纯逻辑无切演算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}(q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}(q)\\)</span> 为相继式中两侧公式出现的集合，来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\pi\">\\(S_\\pi\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_\\pi:=\\operatorname{Fml}(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_\\pi:=\\operatorname{Fml}(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in D\\quad\n\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S_\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u\\in D\\quad\n\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S_\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由根向叶按地址长度归纳。结构规则的前提只删去重复或新增的结论出现，或重排出现；命题规则的辅助公式为主公式的子公式。量词规则的辅助公式先取量词体，再作合法项实例，恰为 An 的两种闭包。LJ 的两条单支析取规则同样满足。有限树上逐边传播得到全部节点。没有加入非逻辑公理或归纳规则；也没有把量词实例误称为字面的子公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-analytic-formula-closure","status":"resolved","id":"64d508412cdc602b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma\\}$ 为本册纯逻辑无切演算；$\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}$。$\\operatorname{Fml}(q)$ 为相继式中两侧公式出现的集合，来自 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]]；$S_\\pi$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fml}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"S_\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"S_\\pi:=\\operatorname{Fml}(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u\\in D\\quad\n\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S_\\pi).","display":true}],"bytes":1887,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property